  <h2>Call for Contributions</h2>
  <p>The call invited extended abstracts and demos. Abstracts were limited to four pages in ICRA PDF format. Accepted contributions were presented during the workshop and poster session; demo proposals were handled directly by the organizers.</p>

  <h2>Important Dates</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Submission deadline: April 2, 2025</li>
    <li>Acceptance notification: April 7, 2025</li>
    <li>Final version: April 15, 2025</li>
    <li>Workshop: May 23, 2025, Atlanta</li>
  </ul>


</Workshop2025>
